  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 591.03 Convictions. For the purposes of this chapter, conviction shall mean any criminal, civil, or administrative findings of guilt by a governmental entity upon proper adjudication.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5901.03), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
